@startuml

footbox off

title Sequence Diagram - US007 Register a new country in the System

box #LightYellow
actor Administrator
participant ":UI" as UI
end box

participant ":CityController" as CityController
participant ":CityRepository" as AddressRepository

Administrator -> UI : **1** I want to register a new city
UI --> Administrator : **2** What city and from which country?
Administrator -> UI : **3** The city is <name> and the country is  <country>

UI -> CityController : **4** registerNewCity (name, country)
activate CityController

CityController -> AddressRepository : **5** createAndAddNewCity (name, country)
activate AddressRepository

create "newCity1: City" as City
AddressRepository -> City : **6** createCity(name, country)

AddressRepository -> AddressRepository : **7** validate (newCity1)
AddressRepository -> AddressRepository : **8** Add (newCity1)

AddressRepository --> CityController : **9** true
deactivate AddressRepository

CityController --> UI : **10** success
deactivate CityController

UI --> Administrator : **10** Done!

@enduml